# Story List — horizontal snapping ScrollView driving an absolutely-positioned stack
# of 8 story cards (translateX/scale interpolated from the scroll offset).
# What this test covers: paging forward one card at a time, a small drag that
# must snap back to the same card, flinging through to the last card and
# bouncing past the end, paging back to the first card and over-scrolling
# past the start (interpolations with Extrapolation.CLAMP at both edges),
# and reversing direction mid-momentum.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/story-list"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 1000
gesture pan 330 437 -250 0 500
wait 900
gesture pan 330 437 -250 0 500
wait 900
# Small drag below the snap interval: should settle back.
gesture pan 250 437 -40 0 600
wait 900
# Flings to the end, then bounce against the end edge.
gesture fling left 250 437 200
wait 600
gesture fling left 250 437 200
wait 600
gesture fling left 250 437 200
wait 600
gesture fling left 250 437 200
wait 600
gesture fling left 250 437 200
wait 600
gesture fling left 250 437 200
wait 1000
gesture pan 330 437 -250 0 400
wait 1000
# Reverse mid-momentum.
gesture fling right 150 437 200
wait 120
gesture fling left 250 437 200
wait 1000
# Back to the first card and over-scroll the start.
gesture fling right 150 437 200
wait 500
gesture fling right 150 437 200
wait 500
gesture fling right 150 437 200
wait 500
gesture fling right 150 437 200
wait 500
gesture fling right 150 437 200
wait 500
gesture fling right 150 437 200
wait 500
gesture fling right 150 437 200
wait 500
gesture pan 80 437 250 0 400
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
